nge","label":"Mean |Δt change|","type":"number"},{"field":"median_abs_dt_change","label":"Median |Δt change|","type":"number"},{"field":"real_effective_correlation","label":"Real/effective corr.","type":"number"}]},{"id":"integrity_table","title":"Run, checkpoint and artifact integrity","subtitle":"All four runs reached epoch60 and preserve matched cadence selection within each protocol.","dataset":"integrity","sourceId":"integrity_source","density":"spacious","layout":"full","defaultSort":{"field":"run_id","direction":"asc"},"columns":[{"field":"run_id","label":"Run","type":"text"},{"field":"status","label":"Status","type":"text"},{"field":"checkpoint_global_step","label":"Global step","type":"number"},{"field":"checkpoint_tensor_count","label":"State tensors","type":"number"},{"field":"config_sha_match","label":"Config SHA","type":"boolean"},{"field":"manifest_sha_match","label":"Manifest SHA","type":"boolean"},{"field":"cadence_pair_match","label":"Cadence pair","type":"boolean"}]}],"sources":[{"id":"metric_points_source","label":"Reviewed TensorBoard validation metrics","path":"compare_results/data/m2_scratch_time_metric_points_20260724.csv","query":{"language":"sql","engine":"duckdb","sql":"SELECT protocol, time_mode, metric, epoch, value FROM read_csv_auto('compare_results/data/m2_scratch_time_metric_points_20260724.csv') ORDER BY protocol, metric, time_mode, epoch","description":"Read the twelve five-epoch Success and Precision points.","tables_used":["m2_scratch_time_metric_points"],"metric_definitions":["value: nuScenes mini_val Success or Precision in points.","epoch: validation checkpoint epoch; evaluations occur every five epochs."]}},{"id":"comparison_source","label":"Reviewed true-minus-shuffled comparisons","path":"compare_results/data/m2_scratch_time_comparisons_20260724.csv","query":{"language":"sql","engine":"duckdb","sql":"SELECT protocol, metric, final_true, final_shuffled, final_delta, late_delta_45_60, true_win_points, eval_points FROM read_csv_auto('compare_results/data/m2_scratch_time_comparisons_20260724.csv') ORDER BY protocol, metric","description":"Read frozen epoch-60 and robustness comparison metrics.","tables_used":["m2_scratch_time_comparisons"],"metric_definitions":["final_delta: epoch-60 true minus shuffled score in points.","late_delta_45_60: mean true-minus-shuffled delta over epochs 45, 50, 55 and 60.","true_win_points: descriptive count, not an independent-trial significance test."]}},{"id":"loss_source","label":"Reviewed late-training loss ratios","path":"compare_results/data/m2_scratch_time_loss_ratios_20260724.csv","query":{"language":"sql","engine":"duckdb","sql":"SELECT protocol, loss_label, late_true, late_shuffled, shuffled_to_true_ratio FROM read_csv_auto('compare_results/data/m2_scratch_time_loss_ratios_20260724.csv') ORDER BY protocol, loss_metric","description":"Read epochs45-60 batch-mean training loss comparisons.","tables_used":["m2_scratch_time_loss_ratios"],"metric_definitions":["late_true and late_shuffled: mean of epoch-level batch means over epochs 45-60.","shuffled_to_true_ratio: late shuffled loss divided by late true loss."]}},{"id":"manifest_source","label":"Reviewed shuffled-time manifest strength","path":"compare_results/data/m2_scratch_time_manifest_strength_20260724.csv","query":{"language":"sql","engine":"duckdb","sql":"SELECT protocol, role, transition_count, numeric_near_equal_share_1ms, mean_abs_dt_change, median_abs_dt_change, real_effective_correlation FROM read_csv_auto('compare_results/data/m2_scratch_time_manifest_strength_20260724.csv') ORDER BY protocol, role","description":"Read train/val shuffled-time intervention strength checks.","tables_used":["m2_scratch_time_manifest_strength"],"metric_definitions":["mean_abs_dt_change: mean absolute real-versus-effective incoming gap change in seconds.","numeric_near_equal_share_1ms: share of transitions whose gap changes by at most 1 ms."]}},{"id":"integrity_source","label":"Run and checkpoint integrity audit","path":"compare_results/data/m2_scratch_time_integrity_20260724.csv","query":{"language":"sql","engine":"duckdb","sql":"SELECT run_label, status, commit, checkpoint_global_step, config_sha_match, manifest_sha_match, cadence_pair_match FROM read_csv_auto('compare_results/data/m2_scratch_time_integrity_20260724.csv') ORDER BY protocol, time_mode","description":"Read completion, checkpoint, provenance and pairing checks.","tables_used":["m2_scratch_time_integrity"],"metric_definitions":["status PASS requires exit0, epoch59 checkpoint, expected steps/events, clean commit and matching artifacts."]}},{"id":"historical_source","label":"Historical HTV A1 contextual comparison","path":"compare_results/data/m2_scratch_time_historical_context_20260724.csv","query":{"language":"sql","engine":"duckdb","sql":"SELECT protocol, metric, historical_a1_final, current_scratch_m2_true_final, m2_true_minus_historical_a1 FROM read_csv_auto('compare_results/data/m2_scratch_time_historical_context_20260724.csv') ORDER BY protocol, metric","description":"Read contextual, non-matched comparison against older A1 runs.","tables_used":["m2_scratch_time_historical_context"],"metric_definitions":["m2_true_minus_historical_a1: descriptive current scratch M2 true minus older A1 final score."]}}],"blocks":[{"id":"title","type":"markdown","body":"# CT-SeqTrack M2 scratch true/shuffled 训练复核"},{"id":"technical_summary","type":"markdown","body":"## 技术摘要\n\n四组归档、配置、manifest、checkpoint 和事件完整性全部 PASS。按冻结的 epoch60 `last.ckpt`，random20 true−shuffled 为 **+3.758 Success / +7.324 Precision**，gap1124 为 **+1.420/+1.818**。\n\n结论是 **scratch correct-time learnability signal 仅部分成立**：random20 稳定为正，gap1124 只在最后一点为正且 late mean 反向。因此 HTV amplification 不受支持，physical-time causal claim 仍为 No-Go。"},{"id":"final_result","type":"markdown","sourceId":"comparison_source","body":"## epoch60 同向，但证据强度在两个协议间分化\n\n两个 final checkpoint 都显示 true 更高，且 gap1124 的 +1.420/+1.818 超过原先 0.5/1.0 的描述性门槛。不过这个门槛原本用于 same-checkpoint 配对干预，不能直接移植到分别训练的模型上。"},{"id":"final_delta_block","type":"chart","chartId":"final_delta_chart"},{"id":"curve_result","type":"markdown","sourceId":"comparison_source","body":"## random20 的正差贯穿训练，gap1124 的 final 差值不稳健\n\nrandom20 true 在 12 个验证点中赢得 10/12 Success、11/12 Precision。gap1124 只有 3/12、2/12；其 epochs45–60 平均 true−shuffled 为 **-3.013/-4.424**。因此不能用 epoch60 单点声称强 HTV 放大正确时间优势。"},{"id":"success_curve_block","type":"chart","chartId":"success_curve_chart"},{"id":"precision_curve_block","type":"chart","chartId":"precision_curve_chart"},{"id":"loss_conflict","type":"markdown","sourceId":"loss_source","body":"## shuffled 的优化负担更重，但它混入了监督不一致\n\nepochs45–60 的 shuffled displacement auxiliary loss 约为 true 的 random20 4.44×、gap1124 5.97×。这是当前`velocity_pred × effective_dt` 与 real-time velocity/displacement 双监督不相容的直接表现。分训差距因此混合了时间信息、目标一致性和随机优化轨迹，不能解释成纯时间因果。"},{"id":"loss_ratio_block","type":"chart","chartId":"loss_ratio_chart"},{"id":"scope_definitions","type":"markdown","body":"## 范围、指标与比较口径\n\n- 数据：nuScenes-mini Car，mini_train 训练、mini_val 验证。\n- 协议：random20 与 gap1124，各自使用冻结 train/val cadence manifest。\n- 模型：M2 proposal_innovation，从随机初始化训练60轮。\n- 主结果：epoch60 `last.ckpt` 的 Success/Precision。\n- 稳健性：每5轮验证一次，共12点；这些点不是独立重复实验。\n- true/shuffled 只在同一协议内比较。"},{"id":"run_summary_block","type":"table","tableId":"run_summary_table"},{"id":"manifest_result","type":"markdown","sourceId":"manifest_source","body":"## gap1124 的置乱明显更强，但没有产生更稳定的 true 优势\n\n四份 shuffled mapping 都是一一 derangement 且保持 gap 边缘分布。random20 约40–45%的 transition 数值变化≤1ms；gap1124 只有20–25%，平均绝对改变约0.56–0.58秒。干预强度足以排除“gap shuffled 没生效”的解释。"},{"id":"manifest_table_block","type":"table","tableId":"manifest_table"},{"id":"method_integrity","type":"markdown","sourceId":"integrity_source","body":"## 完整性核验支持四组内部可比\n\n四组均为 clean commit 473738f、seed42、scratch、batch16、workers12；退出码为0，checkpoint 达到 epoch59 和预期 global step。协议内 true/shuffled 的 tracklet、frame、cadence selection SHA 完全一致，本地配置/manifest SHA 与服务器 provenance 一致。"},{"id":"integrity_table_block","type":"table","tableId":"integrity_table"},{"id":"limitations","type":"markdown","body":"## 限制与结论边界\n\n当前只有 seed42 和 aggregate mini_val 指标，没有逐 endpoint 输出与 tracklet bootstrap；十二个 epoch 点高度相关。更重要的是 shuffled 分训含结构性辅助目标冲突。因此本批次不能覆盖此前同-checkpoint true/fixed/shuffled 的 physical-time No-Go。"},{"id":"next_steps","type":"markdown","body":"## 推荐下一步\n\n1. 不重训，先对两个协议做 2×2 cross-time evaluation：每个 true/shuffled-trained final checkpoint 分别用 true 与 shuffled val clock 推理。\n2. 导出逐 endpoint 结果并做 tracklet-bootstrap。\n3. 如仍研究分训，预注册无目标冲突的监督合同，并补 current-code matched W0/A1 baseline。\n4. 只有 gap1124 的同-checkpoint 干预和配对统计都支持 true，才补 seed43/44；否则停止 physical-time claim，M3/M4 只能按 time-agnostic robustness 重新立题。"},{"id":"further_questions","type":"markdown","body":"## 仍需回答的问题\n\n- random20 稳定差距中有多少来自正确时间，有多少来自 shuffled auxiliary-conflict？\n- 为什么 gap1124 的 loss 冲突更强，tracking 曲线多数时间仍由 shuffled 占优？\n- 同一 checkpoint 切换 clock 后，方向是否与分训一致？\n- current-code matched W0/A1 的真实基线是多少？"}]},"snapshot":{"version":1,"status":"ready","generatedAt":"2026-07-24T13:00:00+08:00","datasets":{"final_deltas":[{"comparison_label":"random20 · Success","metric":"Success","final_delta":3.7575607299804688},{"comparison_label":"random20 · Precision","metric":"Precision","final_delta":7.324073791503906},{"comparison_label":"gap1124 · Success","metric":"Success","final_delta":1.4200439453125},{"comparison_label":"gap1124 · Precision","metric":"Precision","final_delta":1.8178215026855469}],"success_curve":[{"run_label":"random20 · true","epoch":5,"value":36.394996643066406},{"run_label":"random20 · true","epoch":10,"value":26.056900024414062},{"run_label":"random20 · true","epoch":15,"value":41.801815032958984},{"run_label":"random20 · true","epoch":20,"value":48.085487365722656},{"run_label":"random20 · true","epoch":25,"value":50.13881301879883},{"run_label":"random20 · true","epoch":30,"value":41.72209930419922},{"run_label":"random20 · true","epoch":35,"value":35.86723327636719},{"run_label":"random20 · true","epoch":40,"